 * adds the popover alongside it; our single-swapping-icon design can't do that without showing
 * two account icons. Owning the modal here keeps it mounted across the swap instead — the same
 * always-mounted shape ZimmWishlistAuthDrawer already uses for the wishlist icon below.
 */
