85bd4729 Marcel Angelo Navarro 2026-09-21

feat(plp): SFCC-83/84 quick-add opens the cart drawer, not a toast

Add to Bag on the PLP card fired a success toast on add. Per direct
request, swapped that for opening the cart drawer instead — the same
feedback PDP's own Add to Bag already gives (product-view.tsx's
identical useCartDrawer().onOpen() call). The error path is unchanged;
a failed add still needs its own toast since there's nothing to open
the drawer to confirm.

No trigger element is passed to onOpen() here: unlike PDP's single
button, this fires from inside a .map() over many cards through
ZimmProductCardContent's shared onAddToBag: () => void contract, which
carries no event/ref to thread through. Degrades gracefully per
useCartDrawer.ts's own documented default — AC10 focus-return on close
is less precise than PDP's, not broken. Flagged, not fixed here.


