//    the component for why, and for the deliberate difference from ZimmCartItemActions' own
//    callback-prop shape.
// 6. Both marks' fill CORRECTED from `text.default` to `icon.default` (Tester-found, live
//    evidence: foundation/colour.ts registers both aliases separately — `text.default` and
//    `icon.default` — and both happen to resolve to the same grey[900] value today, but they are
//    a distinct semantic alias pair; a logo/icon glyph fill belongs on the icon one so a future
//    independent re-theme of text vs. icon colour can't silently miscolour this mark).
//    `preserveAspectRatio="none"` also added to both inlined `<chakra.svg>` elements to match the
//    two source files exactly (`overrides/app/assets/svg/{apple,google}-pay-logo.svg` both carry
//    it at the root) — functionally inert today since each mark's own viewBox/width/height are
//    already self-consistent, but a real source-fidelity gap against the committed asset that a
//    future slot-sizing change could otherwise silently reintroduce distortion into with nothing
//    to catch it.

